Relevant tables / columns and how they will be used  

• ORDER_ITEMS  
  – "product_id": join key to the PRODUCTS table  
  – "sale_price": revenue per ordered item (needed for profit)  
  – "created_at": micro‑seconds epoch timestamp → used to derive the month of the order item  
  – "id": primary key (handy in checks)  
  – "status": kept only to show that we are NOT filtering on it  

• PRODUCTS  
  – "id": joins to ORDER_ITEMS."product_id"  
  – "cost": product’s unit cost (needed for profit)  
  – "name": human readable product name to report in the final result  
  – "category" / "brand" etc. (optional exploration)  

(The remaining tables are not strictly needed for the requested calculation.)

-----------------------------------------------------------------
Ten exploratory Snowflake SQL queries  
(each limited to 20 rows, all identifiers in quotes)

```sql
-- 1. Description: quick look at ORDER_ITEMS basic fields.
SELECT "id", "order_id", "product_id", "sale_price", "created_at", "status"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: sample join between ORDER_ITEMS and PRODUCTS to fetch the cost.
SELECT oi."id",
       oi."product_id",
       p."cost",
       oi."sale_price"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
  ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: compute profit for individual order‑items (sale_price - cost).
SELECT oi."id",
       oi."product_id",
       (oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                    AS "profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
  ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: convert micro‑seconds timestamp to DATE, then get month (YYYY‑MM) for a few rows.
SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
       oi."created_at"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: aggregate total profit by month & product (small slice).
SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
       oi."product_id",
       SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                        AS "total_profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
  ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
GROUP BY 1,2
ORDER BY "order_month" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: same as #5 but only months strictly earlier than 2024‑01.
SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
       oi."product_id",
       SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                        AS "total_profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
  ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)) < '2024-01-01'
GROUP BY 1,2
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: rank products by total profit per month.
SELECT *,
       RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY "order_month" ORDER BY "total_profit" DESC) AS "rk"
FROM (
      SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
             oi."product_id",
             SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") AS "total_profit"
      FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
      JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
        ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
      WHERE TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)) < '2024-01-01'
      GROUP BY 1,2
) sub
ORDER BY "order_month" DESC, "rk"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: pick the rank = 1 row (highest profit) for each month.
SELECT *
FROM (
      SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
             oi."product_id",
             SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") AS "total_profit",
             RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM')
                          ORDER BY SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") DESC) AS "rk"
      FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
      JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
        ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
      WHERE TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)) < '2024-01-01'
      GROUP BY 1,2
) ranked
WHERE "rk" = 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: add total cost (sum of p.cost) for those top‑products per month.
SELECT ranked."order_month",
       ranked."product_id",
       SUM(p."cost")                       AS "total_cost",
       SUM(ranked."profit_per_row")        AS "total_profit"
FROM (
      SELECT oi."product_id",
             TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
             (oi."sale_price" - p."cost") AS "profit_per_row",
             RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM')
                          ORDER BY SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") OVER (PARTITION BY TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM'), oi."product_id") DESC) AS "rk"
      FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
      JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
        ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
      WHERE TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)) < '2024-01-01'
) ranked
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS" p
  ON ranked."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE ranked."rk" = 1
GROUP BY ranked."order_month", ranked."product_id"
ORDER BY ranked."order_month"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. Description: FINAL query – for every month (prior to 2024‑01) show
--     the product that achieved the highest total profit along with
--     its total cost and total profit during that month.
SELECT result."order_month",
       result."product_id",
       prod."name"                                    AS "product_name",
       result."total_cost",
       result."total_profit"
FROM (
      SELECT "order_month",
             "product_id",
             SUM("unit_cost")   AS "total_cost",
             SUM("profit")      AS "total_profit"
      FROM (
            SELECT TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM')   AS "order_month",
                   oi."product_id",
                   p."cost"                                                                  AS "unit_cost",
                   (oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                              AS "profit",
                   RANK() OVER (
                       PARTITION BY TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM')
                       ORDER BY SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") OVER (
                               PARTITION BY TO_CHAR(TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)), 'YYYY-MM'),
                                            oi."product_id"
                       ) DESC
                   ) AS "rk"
            FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
            JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"    p
              ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
            WHERE TO_DATE(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000)) < '2024-01-01'
      )
      WHERE "rk" = 1
      GROUP BY "order_month", "product_id"
) result
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS" prod
  ON result."product_id" = prod."id"
ORDER BY result."order_month";
```

These ten queries progress from simple inspection to the complete statement that, when executed, will yield the required month‑by‑month list of the top‑profit product (prior to January 2024) together with its total cost and total profit.
